    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the simplicity and challenge of the classic <i>Wii Play 'Tanks!'</i> minigame, <i>BOMBSHELL BLITZ</i> takes the twin-stick tank shooter premise to the next level with its own action roguelite twists and cute character cast to spice things up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCORE BIG ACROSS SEVERAL  STRATEGIC COURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cadet at Bombshell Military Academy, you'll take on a series of themed testing courses each with their own unique environments that change the style of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/70bbf3d2c0bfed2bdd7038443c330a38.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/70bbf3d2c0bfed2bdd7038443c330a38.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/70bbf3d2c0bfed2bdd7038443c330a38.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER VEHICULAR COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course has its own set of specialised tanks and unique combat platforms that exist to test your abilities. Learn their patterns and devise the best strategies to take them out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/75753d70b03e299119e7d939dd7125fc.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/75753d70b03e299119e7d939dd7125fc.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/75753d70b03e299119e7d939dd7125fc.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> MORE THAN JUST A TANK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat upgrades will let you customise the performance of your tank, but each course also gives you access to special tactical abilities \u2014 command allies, deploy a drone, or call in an airstrike!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/b604f966465885cee75fb3982579a292.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/b604f966465885cee75fb3982579a292.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/b604f966465885cee75fb3982579a292.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IMPRESS YOUR SUPERVISORS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charm a cast of cute, shy, and explosive characters between your exams \u2014 win them over for some extra credit or a little mercy when they test you in combat themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/aecabe2ae13f25ed8463968fe647de1f.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/aecabe2ae13f25ed8463968fe647de1f.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/aecabe2ae13f25ed8463968fe647de1f.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR EXAM PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exercises in each course are predetermined but presented for you to choose from in a random order, with positive/negative modifiers applied to make each run a unique experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e4d43b9651c2a49f8a73dd69c938adb6.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e4d43b9651c2a49f8a73dd69c938adb6.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW ALONG WITH DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo dev I'm working super hard to make <i>BOMBSHELL BLITZ</i> the best it can be! Support me by following me on my socials for sneak peeks and of course wishlisting here on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e906238da139421436959c1bb773642d.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e906238da139421436959c1bb773642d.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e906238da139421436959c1bb773642d.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the simplicity and challenge of the classic <i>Wii Play 'Tanks!'</i> minigame, <i>BOMBSHELL BLITZ</i> takes the twin-stick tank shooter premise to the next level with its own action roguelite twists and cute character cast to spice things up!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCORE BIG ACROSS SEVERAL  STRATEGIC COURSES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a cadet at Bombshell Military Academy, you'll take on a series of themed testing courses each with their own unique environments that change the style of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/70bbf3d2c0bfed2bdd7038443c330a38.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/70bbf3d2c0bfed2bdd7038443c330a38.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/70bbf3d2c0bfed2bdd7038443c330a38.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER VEHICULAR COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every course has its own set of specialised tanks and unique combat platforms that exist to test your abilities. Learn their patterns and devise the best strategies to take them out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/75753d70b03e299119e7d939dd7125fc.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/75753d70b03e299119e7d939dd7125fc.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"ht