pe=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR EXAM PATH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exercises in each course are predetermined but presented for you to choose from in a random order, with positive/negative modifiers applied to make each run a unique experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e4d43b9651c2a49f8a73dd69c938adb6.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e4d43b9651c2a49f8a73dd69c938adb6.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOLLOW ALONG WITH DEVELOPMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a solo dev I'm working super hard to make <i>BOMBSHELL BLITZ</i> the best it can be! Support me by following me on my socials for sneak peeks and of course wishlisting here on Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e906238da139421436959c1bb773642d.poster.avif?t=1745962857\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e906238da139421436959c1bb773642d.webm?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3445610/extras/e906238da139421436959c1bb773642d.mp4?t=1745962857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
